text\/css\" data-created_by=\"avia_inline_auto\" id=\"style-css-av-93bxxm-60816b0e8809ad3d7f25b238aae113b1\">\n#top .av-special-heading.av-93bxxm-60816b0e8809ad3d7f25b238aae113b1{\npadding-bottom:20px;\nfont-size:40px;\n}\nbody .av-special-heading.av-93bxxm-60816b0e8809ad3d7f25b238aae113b1 .av-special-heading-tag .heading-char{\nfont-size:25px;\n}\n#top #wrap_all .av-special-heading.av-93bxxm-60816b0e8809ad3d7f25b238aae113b1 .av-special-heading-tag{\nfont-size:40px;\n}\n.av-special-heading.av-93bxxm-60816b0e8809ad3d7f25b238aae113b1 .av-subheading{\nfont-size:15px;\n}\n\n@media only screen and (min-width: 480px) and (max-width: 767px){ \n#top #wrap_all .av-special-heading.av-93bxxm-60816b0e8809ad3d7f25b238aae113b1 .av-special-heading-tag{\nfont-size:0.8em;\n}\n}\n\n@media only screen and (max-width: 479px){ \n#top #wrap_all .av-special-heading.av-93bxxm-60816b0e8809ad3d7f25b238aae113b1 .av-special-heading-tag{\nfont-size:0.8em;\n}\n}\n<\/style>\n<div  class='av-special-heading av-93bxxm-60816b0e8809ad3d7f25b238aae113b1 av-special-heading-h2 blockquote modern-quote  avia-builder-el-14  el_before_av_hr  avia-builder-el-first  av-inherit-size'><h2 class='av-special-heading-tag '  itemprop=\"headline\"  >Opakowania<\/h2><div class=\"special-heading-border\"><div class=\"special-heading-inner-border\"><\/div><\/div><\/div><br \/>\n\n<style type=\"text\/css\" data-created_by=\"avia_inline_auto\" id=\"style-css-av-8vz72i-4591fb7f6513e2fed5b15f92cc3251a7\">\n#top .hr.av-8vz72i-4591fb7f6513e2fed5b15f92cc3251a7{\nmargin-bottom:10px;\n}\n.hr.av-8vz72i-4591fb7f6513e2fed5b15f92cc3251a7 .hr-inner{\nwidth:50px;\nborder-color:#ed1c24;\n}\n<\/style>\n<div  class='hr av-8vz72i-4591fb7f6513e2fed5b15f92cc3251a7 hr-custom  avia-builder-el-15  el_after_av_heading  el_before_av_textblock  hr-left hr-icon-no'><span class='hr-inner inner-border-av-border-fat'><span class=\"hr-inner-style\"><\/span><\/span><\/div><br \/>\n<section  class='av_textblock_section av-8gqcky-ac4fc8f8eb40153648667fd2f2312670 '   itemscope=\"itemscope\" itemtype=\"https:\/\/schema.org\/CreativeWork\" ><div class='avia_textblock'  itemprop=\"text\" ><p>Produkujemy opakowania z polietylenu wysokoci\u015bnieniowego w technologii wyt\u0142aczania z rozdmuchu. Opakowania HDPE wytwarzamy na w\u0142asne potrzeby jak r\u00f3wnie\u017c oferujemy je na sprzeda\u017c. Produkujemy opakowania o pojemno\u015bciach 0,5L, 1L, 4L, 5L, 7L, 10L, 20L.<\/p>\n<p>Nowoczesne maszyny i wykwalifikowana kadra z ogromnym do\u015bwiadczeniem, s\u0105 gwarantem najwy\u017cszej jako\u015bci produkowanych opakowa\u0144. Naszym klientom oferujemy mo\u017cliwo\u015b\u0107 doboru koloru opakowa\u0144 jak i personalizacji w zakresie marek w\u0142asnych (private label). Mo\u017cemy r\u00f3wnie\u017c wyprodukowa\u0107 opakowania z wyt\u0142oczonym logo lub nazw\u0105 firmy klienta.<\/p>\n<\/div><\/section><\/p><\/div><\/p>\n\n<style type=\"text\/css\" data-created_by=\"avia_inline_auto\" id=\"style-css-av-aerdae-036e9fe60b5057638ce54101670c70b0\">\n.flex_column.av-aerdae-036e9fe60b5057638ce54101670c70b0{\nborder-radius:0px 0px 0px 0px;\npadding:0px 0px 0px 0px;\n}\n<\/style>\n<div  class='flex_column av-aerdae-036e9fe60b5057638ce54101670c70b0 av_one_half  avia-builder-el-17  el_after_av_one_half  el_before_av_one_half  flex_column_div av-zero-column-padding  column-top-margin'     ><p>\n<style type=\"text\/css\" data-created_by=\"avia_inline_auto\" id=\"style-css-av-lyg90e6w-242a457d8808d56cb2ca4af75e41ec69\">\n#top .av-special-heading.av-lyg90e6w-242a457d8808d56cb2ca4af75e41ec69{\npadding-bottom:20px;\nfont-size:40px;\n}\nbody .av-special-heading.av-lyg90e6w-242a457d8808d56cb2ca4af75e41ec69 .av-special-heading-tag .heading-char{\nfont-size:25px;\n}\n#top #wrap_all .av-special-heading.av-lyg90e6w-242a457d8808d56cb2ca4af75e41ec69 .av-special-heading-tag{\nfont-size:40px;\n}\n.av-special-heading.av-lyg90e6w-242a457d8808d56cb2ca4af75e41ec69 .av-subheading{\nfont-size:15px;\n}\n\n@media only screen and (min-width: 480px) and (max-width: 767px){ \n#top #wrap_all .av-special-heading.av-lyg90e6w-242a457d8808d56cb2ca4af75e41ec69 .av-special-heading-tag{\nfont-size:0.8em;\n}\n}\n\n@media only screen and (max-width: 479px){ \n#top #wrap_all .av-special-heading.av-lyg90e6w-242a457d8808d56cb2ca4af75e41ec69 .av-special-heading-tag{\nfont-size:0.8em;\n}\n}\n<\/style>\n<div  class='av-special-heading av-lyg90e6w-242a457d8808d56cb2ca4af75e41ec69 av-special-heading-h2 blockquote modern-quote  avia-builder-el-18  el_before_av_hr  avia-builder-el-first  av-inherit-size'><h2 class='av-special-heading-tag '  itemprop=\"headline\"  >Konfekcjonowanie<\/h2><div class=\"special-heading-border\"><div class=\"special-heading-inner-border\"><\/div><\/div><\/div><br \/>\n\n<style type=\"text\/css\" data-created_by=\"avia_inline_auto\" id=\"style-css-av-97fvba-cfa9c6e567ff88280ef095df6dd27fba\">\n#top .hr.av-97fvba-cfa9c6e567ff88280ef095df6dd27fba{\nmargin-bottom:10px;\n}\n.hr.av-97fvba-cfa9c6e567ff88280ef095df6dd27fba .hr-inner{\nwidth:50px;\nborder-color:#ed1c24;\n}\n<\/style>\n<div  class='hr av-97fvba-cfa9c6e567ff88280ef095df6dd27fba hr-custom  avia-builder-el-19  el_after_av_heading  el_before_av_textblock  hr-left hr-icon-no'><span class='hr-inner inner-border-av-border-fat'><span class=\"hr-inner-style\"><\/span><\/span><\/div><br \/>\n<section  class='av_textblock_section av-lyg90ou3-15b1744a7974424a9a302f50ee91c78d '   itemscope=\"itemscope\" itemtype=\"https:\/\/schema.org\/CreativeWork\" ><div class='avia_textblock'  itemprop=\"text\" ><p>Konfekcjonowanie oraz pakowanie naszych produkt\u00f3w odbywa si\u0119 na nowoczesnych zautomatyzowanych i zrobotyzowanych liniach nalewczo-pakuj\u0105cych. Posiadamy trzy ca\u0142kowicie automatyczne, o du\u017cej wydajno\u015bci, linie nalewczo-pakuj\u0105ce, oraz trzy linie cz\u0119\u015bciowo automatyczne. Kadra pracownicza dok\u0142ada stara\u0144 aby nasze wyroby by\u0142y zapakowane w spos\u00f3b estetyczny, trwa\u0142y i dobrze oznakowany.<\/p>\n<p>Produkty opuszczaj\u0105ce nasz\u0105 fabryk\u0119 s\u0105 zabezpieczone zamkni\u0119ciem z plomb\u0105 indukcyjn\u0105. Nad ca\u0142o\u015bci\u0105 operacji produkcyjnych czuwa dedykowany program komputerowy typu PMS (production managment system).<\/p>\n<\/div><\/section><\/p><\/div>\n\n<style type=\"text\/css\" data-created_by=\"avia_inline_auto\" id=\"style-css-av-6x6u3a-70185925ab1605c0ac096fde76fa716e\">\n.flex_column.av-6x6u3a-70185925ab1605c0ac096fde76fa716e{\nborder-radius:0px 0px 0px 0px;\npadding:0px 0px 0px 0px;\n}\n<\/style>\n<div  class='flex_column av-6x6u3a-70185925ab1605c0ac096fde76fa716e av_one_half  avia-builder-el-21  el_after_av_one_half  el_before_av_one_half  first flex_column_div av-zero-column-padding  column-top-margin'     ><p>\n<style type=\"text\/css\" data-created_by=\"avia_inline_auto\" id=\"style-css-av-lyg919jt-2c72f2d7438feb5e4fb9e84ba6bef8fa\">\n#top .av-special-heading.av-lyg919jt-2c72f2d7438feb5e4fb9e84ba6bef8fa{\npadding-bottom:20px;\nfont-size:40px;\n}\nbody .av-special-heading.av-lyg919jt-2c72f2d7438feb5e4fb9e84ba6bef8fa .av-special-heading-tag .heading-char{\nfont-size:25px;\n}\n#top #wrap_all .av-special-heading.av-lyg919jt-2c72f2d7438feb5e4fb9e84ba6bef8fa .av-special-heading-tag{\nfont-size:40px;\n}\n.av-special-heading.av-lyg919jt-2c72f2d7438feb5e4fb9e84ba6bef8fa .av-subheading{\nfont-size:15px;\n}\n\n@media only screen and (min-width: 480px) and (max-width: 767px){ \n#top #wrap_all .av-special-heading.av-lyg919jt-2c72f2d7438feb5e4fb9e84ba6bef8fa .av-special-heading-tag{\nfont-size:0.8em;\n}\n}\n\n@media only screen and (max-width: 479px){ \n#top #wrap_all .av-special-heading.av-lyg919jt-2c72f2d7438feb5e4fb9e84ba6bef8fa .av-special-heading-tag{\nfont-size:0.8em;\n}\n}\n<\/style>\n<div  class='av-special-heading av-lyg919jt-2c72f2d7438feb5e4fb9e84ba6bef8fa av-special-heading-h2 blockquote modern-quote  avia-builder-el-22  el_before_av_hr  avia-builder-el-first  av-inherit-size'><h2 class='av-special-heading-tag '  itemprop=\"headline\"  >Blendownia<\/h2><div class=\"special-heading-border\"><div class=\"special-heading-inner-border\"><\/div><\/div><\/div><br \/>\n\n<style type=\"text\/css\" data-created_by=\"avia_inline_auto\" id=\"style-css-av-5moo12-de410cde88bc16a3984cb8d7170bb2f0\">\n#top .hr.av-5moo12-de410cde88bc16a3984cb8d7170bb2f0{\nmargin-bottom:10px;\n}\n.hr.av-5moo12-de410cde88bc16a3984cb8d7170bb2f0 .hr-inner{\nwidth:50px;\nborder-color:#ed1c24;\n}\n<\/style>\n<div  class='hr av-5moo12-de410cde88bc16a3984cb8d7170bb2f0 hr-custom  avia-builder-el-23  el_after_av_heading  el_before_av_textblock  hr-left hr-icon-no'><span class='hr-inner inner-border-av-border-fat'><span class=\"hr-inner-style\"><\/span><\/span><\/div><br \/>\n<section  class='av_textblock_section av-lyg91v0k-bcaf76031651a632c37fab3e63912be6 '   itemscope=\"itemscope\" itemtype=\"https:\/\/schema.org\/CreativeWork\" ><div class='avia_textblock'  itemprop=\"text\" ><p>Produkcja olej\u00f3w odbywa si\u0119 w nowoczesnej i skomputeryzowanej blendowni wyposa\u017conej w 7 mieszalnik\u00f3w wyposa\u017conych w system grzania, odmierzania i filtracji.<\/p>\n<p>Dozowanie surowc\u00f3w do produkcji oraz transfer gotowych produkt\u00f3w z blendowni odbywa si\u0119 za po\u015brednictwem systemu PIGING. System PIGING jest oparty na t\u0142okach znajduj\u0105cych si\u0119 we wn\u0119trzu ruroci\u0105gu nap\u0119dzanych spr\u0119\u017conym powietrzem.<\/p>\n<p>Gwarantuje on powtarzalno\u015b\u0107 produkcji i jej czysto\u015b\u0107 poniewa\u017c po ka\u017cdej operacji ruroci\u0105gi wewn\u0105trz s\u0105 opr\u00f3\u017cnione i czyszczone. Daje nam to pewno\u015b\u0107 dok\u0142adnego nawa\u017cania surowc\u00f3w i zapobiega mieszaniu si\u0119 ze sob\u0105 r\u00f3\u017cnych produkt\u00f3w.\u00a0 Ca\u0142y proces blendowania jest monitorowany przez wykwalifikowan\u0105 kadr\u0119.<\/p>\n<\/div><\/section><\/p><\/div>\n\n<style type=\"text\/css\" data-created_by=\"avia_inline_auto\" id=\"style-css-av-42zzti-e7264b2bbdc095bd0fd54145835c3084\">\n.flex_column.av-42zzti-e7264b2bbdc095bd0fd54145835c3084{\nborder-radius:0px 0px 0px 0px;\npadding:0px 0px 0px 0px;\n}\n<\/style>\n<div  class='flex_column av-42zzti-e7264b2bbdc095bd0fd54145835c3084 av_one_half  avia-builder-el-25  el_after_av_one_half  avia-builder-el-last  flex_column_div av-zero-column-padding  column-top-margin'     ><p>\n<style type=\"text\/css\" data-created_by=\"avia_inline_auto\" id=\"style-css-av-lyg92c79-16c2f4cb971393879f3952c783fd968f\">\n#top .av-special-heading.av-lyg92c79-16c2f4cb971393879f3952c783fd968f{\npadding-bottom:20px;\nfont-size:40px;\n}\nbody .av-special-heading.av-lyg92c79-16c2f4cb971393879f3952c783fd968f .av-special-heading-tag .heading-char{\nfont-size:25px;\n}\n#top #wrap_all .av-special-heading.av-lyg92c79-16c2f4cb971393879f3952c783fd968f .av-special-heading-tag{\nfont-size:40px;\n}\n.av-special-heading.av-lyg92c79-16c2f4cb971393879f3952c783fd968f .av-subheading{\nfont-size:15px;\n}\n\n@media only screen and (min-width: 480px) and (max-width: 767px){ \n#top #wrap_all .av-special-heading.av-lyg92c79-16c2f4cb971393879f3952c783fd968f .av-special-heading-tag{\nfont-size:0.8em;\n}\n}\n\n@media only screen and (max-width: 479px){ \n#top #wrap_all .av-special-heading.av-lyg92c79-16c2f4cb971393879f3952c783fd968f .av-special-heading-tag{\nfont-size:0.8em;\n}\n}\n<\/style>\n<div  class='av-special-heading av-lyg92c79-16c2f4cb971393879f3952c783fd968f av-special-heading-h2 blockquote modern-quote  avia-builder-el-26  el_before_av_hr  avia-builder-el-first  av-inherit-size'><h2 class='av-special-heading-tag '  itemprop=\"headline\"  >Magazyn<\/h2><div class=\"special-heading-border\"><div class=\"special-heading-inner-border\"><\/div><\/div><\/div><br \/>\n\n<style type=\"text\/css\" data-created_by=\"avia_inline_auto\" id=\"style-css-av-31egyu-6f514170fdfc52417e6422db57280393\">\n#top .hr.av-31egyu-6f514170fdfc52417e6422db57280393{\nmargin-bottom:10px;\n}\n.hr.av-31egyu-6f514170fdfc52417e6422db57280393 .hr-inner{\nwidth:50px;\nborder-color:#ed1c24;\n}\n<\/style>\n<div  class='hr av-31egyu-6f514170fdfc52417e6422db57280393 hr-custom  avia-builder-el-27  el_after_av_heading  el_before_av_textblock  hr-left hr-icon-no'><span class='hr-inner inner-border-av-border-fat'><span class=\"hr-inner-style\"><\/span><\/span><\/div><br \/>\n<section  class='av_textblock_section av-lyg92ooy-1a5e556eccbdbd40585a0e4d2f43e22f '   itemscope=\"itemscope\" itemtype=\"https:\/\/schema.org\/CreativeWork\" ><div class='avia_textblock'  itemprop=\"text\" ><p>Posiadamy kilka magazyn\u00f3w o \u0142\u0105cznej pojemno\u015bci 4500 miejsc paletowych. W poszczeg\u00f3lnych sekcjach magazynowych zastosowano r\u00f3\u017cne systemy wspomagaj\u0105ce procesy magazynowe takie jak: System rega\u0142\u00f3w wjezdnych (drive-in rack), system rega\u0142\u00f3w wykorzystuj\u0105cych platformy sterowane radiowo (radioshuttle), system rega\u0142\u00f3w przesuwnych (mooving racks). Wszystkie te systemy s\u0105 skojarzone z programem typu WMS (warehouse managment system), kt\u00f3ry zapewnia \u017ce wyroby s\u0105 w\u0142a\u015bciwie sk\u0142adowane a ich rozmieszczenie jest w pe\u0142ni identyfikowalne.<\/p>\n<p>Do obs\u0142ugi magazynu wykorzystujemy niezawodne w\u00f3zki reach truck marki STILL, HYSTER i JUNGHEINRICH. Ca\u0142y park maszynowy jest oparty na elektromobilno\u015bci, co wspomaga dba\u0142o\u015b\u0107 o \u015brodowisko.<\/p>\n<p>Specjalizujemy si\u0119 w za\u0142adunkach kontener\u00f3w morskich, co wymaga specjalnych rozwi\u0105za\u0144 i precyzji w procesie rozmieszczania towaru w kontenerze.<\/p>\n<\/div><\/section><\/p><\/div>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"","protected":false},"author":5,"featured_media":0,"parent":3155,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"footnotes":""},"class_list":["post-3318","page","type-page","status-publish","hentry"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/venol.de\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages\/3318","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/venol.de\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/venol.de\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/page"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/venol.de\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/5"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/venol.de\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=3318"}],"version-history":[{"count":20,"href":"https:\/\/venol.de\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages\/3318\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":5630,"href":"https:\/\/venol.de\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages\/3318\/revisions\/5630"}],"up":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/venol.de\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages\/3155"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/venol.de\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=3318"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https:\/\/api.w.org\/{rel}","templated":true}]}}